{"t":"Blue Robe","s":"blue-robe-45e89","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Blue_Robe_36c1c3.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Blue Robe</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Blue Robe\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Robe_36c1c3.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"imbueslots\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Imbuing Slots</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgradeclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"armor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Armor</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Body Equipment<br/>Armors</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">22.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10,000 - 15,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.6<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">February 18, 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20070311041849&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Robe_36c1c3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a blue robe <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:11)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot, Empty Slot).<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 22.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It is a magic robe.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It's a decent armor for anyone looking to save capacity. It can be used by any vocation but there are usually better armors available.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> can use Paladin Armor.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> can use Ethno Coat, Spirit Cloak, Focus Cape.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Armor\">Golden Armor</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\">Dragon Scale Mail</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Armor\">Demon Armor</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>It may be a good option for a low-level knight who only blocks more damage in armor upgrades, while the other vocations improve their skills to deal more damage. The extra capacity will allow the knight to carry more potions.\n</p><p>It was very attractive for Mages before the Summer Update 2008. Most mages now prefer to use a Spirit Cloak or Focus Cape for the extra Magic Level although Spirit Cloaks are heavier and have less defense and Focus Capes have less defense but is lighter. On the Test Server (8.2), Blue Robe added an extra Magic Level, however the convenience was removed after the Test Server. Many people believed that these robes increased magic damage by 25%, however this rumor was (and is) false.\nObtainable in the <a href=\"#/quest/medusa-shield-quest\">Medusa Shield Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Some say this magical robe was found in a Cyclops in 6.4. It just said \"Blue Robe\" with the attributes of a Cape. Some think it was hackers who put it in. It wasn't until 7.4 that this \"Blue Robe\" was put in the game as a new item.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Banshee\">Banshee</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Countess%20Sorrow\">Countess Sorrow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enlightened%20of%20the%20Cult\">Enlightened of the Cult</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feversleep\">Feversleep</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Flower%20Asura\">Frost Flower Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Girtablilu%20Warrior\">Girtablilu Warrior</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gravelord%20Oshuran\">Gravelord Oshuran</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"